sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client<br/>(AI Application)
    participant Gateway as vllm-orchestrator-gateway<br/>8090/TCP HTTP
    participant Orchestrator as FMS Guardrails Orchestrator<br/>8085/TCP HTTP/HTTPS
    participant Detectors as Detector Services
    participant vLLM as vLLM Model Server

    Note over Client,vLLM: Flow 1: Non-Streaming Chat Completion with Detection

    Client->>Gateway: POST /{route_name}/v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTP 8090/TCP (plaintext)<br/>Auth: Authorization header (pass-through)
    Note over Gateway: Inject route-specific detector<br/>specs (input/output detectors)<br/>into request payload
    Gateway->>Orchestrator: POST /api/v2/chat/completions-detection<br/>HTTP/HTTPS 8085/TCP<br/>Auth: mTLS client cert + forwarded Authorization
    Orchestrator->>Detectors: Run input detectors<br/>(per route config)
    Detectors-->>Orchestrator: Detection results
    Orchestrator->>vLLM: LLM inference request
    vLLM-->>Orchestrator: Generated response
    Orchestrator->>Detectors: Run output detectors<br/>(per route config)
    Detectors-->>Orchestrator: Detection results
    Orchestrator-->>Gateway: Response with detections<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    Note over Gateway: If detections found AND<br/>fallback_message configured:<br/>replace content with fallback
    Gateway-->>Client: JSON Response<br/>HTTP (plaintext)

    Note over Client,vLLM: Flow 2: Streaming Chat Completion (SSE)

    Client->>Gateway: POST /{route_name}/v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTP 8090/TCP (plaintext)<br/>stream: true
    Gateway->>Orchestrator: POST /api/v2/chat/completions-detection<br/>HTTP/HTTPS 8085/TCP (streaming)<br/>Auth: mTLS + forwarded Authorization
    loop SSE chunks
        Orchestrator-->>Gateway: SSE data chunk<br/>(StreamingResponse)
        Note over Gateway: Parse each SSE chunk;<br/>if detections in chunk AND<br/>fallback configured: replace<br/>delta content, set finish_reason="stop"
        Gateway-->>Client: SSE data chunk<br/>text/event-stream
    end
